            "text": "Welcome to Shopcart TVT! By accessing and using our website, you agree to comply with the terms and conditions set forth in this document."
          },
          {
            "subtitle": "1.2 Scope",
            "text": "These terms apply to all users, including visitors, registered customers, and anyone using our services."
          },
          {
            "subtitle": "1.3 Updates",
            "text": "We reserve the right to update terms at any time. The latest version will be posted here with a clear effective date."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "title": "2. Ownership & Copyright",
        "content": [
          {
            "subtitle": "2.1 Content",
            "text": "All website content including text, images, logos, graphics, and software are property of Shopcart TVT or its licensed partners."
          },
          {
            "subtitle": "2.2 Usage",
            "text": "You may not copy, distribute, or modify any content for commercial purposes without written consent."
          },
          {
            "subtitle": "2.3 Link Sharing",
            "text": "Sharing links to our website is allowed, provided it is not misleading or harmful to the brand."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "title": "3. User Accounts",
        "content": [
          {
            "subtitle": "3.1 Registration",
            "text": "To use full features, register with accurate information. You are responsible for your account security."
          },
          {
            "subtitle": "3.2 Responsibility",
            "text": "All activities on your account are considered yours. Notify us immediately of unauthorized access."
          },
          {
            "subtitle": "3.3 Termination",
            "text": "We may suspend or terminate accounts for violations or fraudulent behavior."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "title": "4. Payment & Pricing",
        "content": [
          {
            "subtitle": "4.1 Pricing",
            "text": "Prices include VAT (unless noted). Prices are subject to change without notice."
          },
          {
            "subtitle": "4.2 Methods",
            "text": "We accept COD, bank transfer, cards, e-wallets, and 0% installments."
          },
          {
            "subtitle": "4.3 Security",
            "text": "Transactions are encrypted via 256-bit SSL and comply with PCI DSS standards."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "title": "5. Shipping & Delivery",
        "content": [
          {
            "subtitle": "5.1 Scope",
            "text": "We deliver nationwide. Delivery takes 1-7 business days depending on location."
          },
          {
            "subtitle": "5.2 Fees",
            "text": "Fees are based on weight and distance. Free shipping for orders over 500,000 VND."
          },
          {
            "subtitle": "5.3 Inspection",
            "text": "You may inspect items before receiving. Refuse delivery if items are incorrect or damaged."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "title": "6. Returns & Refunds",
        "content": [
          {
            "subtitle": "6.1 Period",
            "text": "Request exchange/return within 30 days if items are unused and have original tags."
          },
          {
            "subtitle": "6.2 Process",
            "text": "Refunds are processed within 3-5 business days after product inspection."
          },
          {
            "subtitle": "6.3 Exceptions",
            "text": "Underwear, opened cosmetics, or custom products are not eligible for return."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "title": "7. Privacy & Security",
        "content": [
          {
            "subtitle": "7.1 Collection",
            "text": "We collect data to process orders and improve services, secured per our privacy policy."
          },
          {
            "subtitle": "7.2 Usage",
            "text": "Information is only used for stated purposes and not shared with third parties (except shipping)."
          },
          {
            "subtitle": "7.3 Cookies",
            "text": "We use cookies to improve experience. You can disable them in browser settings."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "title": "8. Liability",
        "content": [
          {
            "subtitle": "8.1 Responsibility",
            "text": "Shopcart TVT provides quality service but is not liable for losses beyond our control."
          },
          {
            "subtitle": "8.2 Lawful Use",
            "text": "You commit to using our services for lawful purposes. Violations result in service refusal."
          },
